<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB details 1996 segment revenue.</title>
<headline>ABB details 1996 segment revenue.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996 vs 1995:</p>
<p>				     (million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Net group revenue	    34,574	  vs 33,738</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p> Power Generation		9,697	  vs 10,290</p>
<p> Power Transmission	    9,025	  vs  8,144</p>
<p> Industry, Building Systems 16,067	  vs 14,931</p>
<p> Adtranz -transportation     2,008	  vs  2,882</p>
<p> Financial Services		479	  vs    446</p>
<p> Various, Corporate	    3,321	  vs  3,179</p>
<p> Intra-Group		     6,023	  vs  6,134</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG.</p>
<p>-- Peter Nielsen, Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
